flowchart TB
  U[URL only] --> A["acquire(url, write)<br/>Write HTML + multiple images<br/>Returns Artifact[]"]
  A --> H[Host completes ingestion atomically<br/>Returned artifacts become originals<br/>Acquisition failure: no Input]
  B[Uploaded files / folders<br/>Pasted text / browser capture<br/>Already downloaded bytes] -->|direct ingestion: bypass acquisition| H
  H --> I[Input: inputId + originals array<br/>Every artifact has stored bytes<br/>Each artifact has its own origin]
  I --> P["process(input, {read, write})<br/>Returns Publication[]<br/>Process assigned batch once"]
  P --> M["Return Publication[]<br/>Artifact files + explicit search strings"]
  M --> V[Host validates ALL manifests]
  V -->|valid| S[Create items atomically<br/>Host assigns each item ID<br/>Mark Input processed]
  V -->|invalid / processing failure| X[No published items]
  S --> R[Per-item search + readable fallback<br/>Optional component loads private files<br/>Read only explicit artifact set]
